issue.body:
in starlette.authentication.SimpleUser,it says
```py
class SimpleUser(BaseUser):
    def __init__(self, username: str) -> None:
        self.username = username

    @property
    def is_authenticated(self) -> bool:
        return True

    @property
    def display_name(self) -> str:
        return self.username
```
this cause a variable 'username' appeared in request.user
if modified to
```py
class SimpleUser(BaseUser):
    def __init__(self, username: str) -> None:
        self._username = username

    @property
    def is_authenticated(self) -> bool:
        return True

    @property
    def display_name(self) -> str:
        return self._username
```
there is not redundant variable 'username'
